                                                "sense_id": "ea4be556-3649-3ae0-90f0-16e94696fb90",
                                                "text": "quoted in 1851, James Baillie Fraser, Military Memoir of Lieut.-Col. James Skinner\nBoth gholes attempted to turn his flanks, but the men behaved ill, and we were repulsed."
                                            }
